.2,1954,44,129,25]],"links":[["Woodward County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oklahoma/woodward-county"],["ARC or PLC in Woodward County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/woodward-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Woodward County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 43 of the 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 200% of normal in August to September but only 19% in February to March. So far in 2026 the middle ran 35% of normal in March to April and 37% in April to May.</p>"}
